  "description": "Reborn as a side character in a novel, Marin swears she’ll avoid every major figure in the story. But when her family collapses overnight, she finds herself cast out onto the streets with nothing.\n\n*\" I need money—fast.\"*\n\nForced by circumstance, she accepts a six-month temporary position at the estate of the novel’s blind male lead, Duke Gerald.\n\n*“How is life in the duke’s manor?”\n\n“Thanks to Your Grace’s generosity, I’m living quite comfortably.”\n\n“You like living here? Then we should get engaged.”*\n\nMarin freezes. How does enjoying life in the manor suddenly connect to an engagement?\n\n*“Congratulations. Now you can keep living in the place you like.”\n\n“By any chance… do I have the right to refuse?”*\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
